Testing and Quality Assurance 
1. Testing MVC layers - Model: Test data operations (e.g., CRUD) with mocked data. - Service: Test business logic with unit tests. - Controller: Test HTTP endpoints with integration tests. 
2. Tools for API testing - Unit testing: Jest, Mocha. - Integration testing: Supertest for Express endpoints. - Load testing: Artillery or k6. 
3. Ensuring reliability - HandlePerformance and Optimization 
1. Compression middleware Reduces response size, lowering bandwidth usage and improving response times. 
2. Optimizing file I/O - Use asynchronous I/O (fs.promises). - Cache frequently accessed data in memory. - Batch writes to reduce file operations. 
3. edge cases (e.g., invalid IDs, empty inputs). - Use automated tests and monitoring for uptime.
